[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 20883.99, "timestamp": "05:48:03", "text": "所以她越是开始这样做，就越是如此。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20888.868, "timestamp": "05:48:08", "text": "东西什么的，嗯，就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20891.11, "timestamp": "05:48:11", "text": "再次强调，艾普丽尔真的是个很善良的女孩。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 20892.148, "timestamp": "05:48:12", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "one day the townsfolk were like, lets play a lil prank on her"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20894.948, "timestamp": "05:48:14", "text": "打个电话或者做点什么，嗯。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20903.39, "timestamp": "05:48:23", "text": "什么？哦等等，哦等等，我的故事"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20905.07, "timestamp": "05:48:25", "text": "你的故事也有些类似。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 20906.528, "timestamp": "05:48:26", "author": "@adthirnegii555", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/2Cc1YwU-uCrqW2z5qvi5AkqQE1B24SRxdmfPyDze9eyV1Sux1rRBrAOLxTFmE3GC3YMqYbZsL6k=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "owo"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20907.868, "timestamp": "05:48:27", "text": "但情况完全不同，好吧，所以人们是"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 20911.132, "timestamp": "05:48:31", "author": "@adthirnegii555", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/2Cc1YwU-uCrqW2z5qvi5AkqQE1B24SRxdmfPyDze9eyV1Sux1rRBrAOLxTFmE3GC3YMqYbZsL6k=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "🧐🤔"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20912.468, "timestamp": "05:48:32", "text": "那个叫Okay的人，她正在努力让自己开心起来。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 20915.534, "timestamp": "05:48:35", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "so they went upto her husband, who was taking care of their daughter "}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20915.67, "timestamp": "05:48:35", "text": "哦，啊，我当时感觉自己好像要走上……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20917.91, "timestamp": "05:48:37", "text": "四月是你知道的那个爱恶作剧的人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20921.27, "timestamp": "05:48:41", "text": "镇上的人都叫她艾普丽尔。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20925.23, "timestamp": "05:48:45", "text": "傻瓜们，不，她恶作剧了，所以她做了件大事"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 20926.373, "timestamp": "05:48:46", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "and they were asking if he could join em on the prank"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20927.67, "timestamp": "05:48:47", "text": "搞了个大恶作剧，然后死了或者发生了什么事"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 20936.563, "timestamp": "05:48:56", "author": "@adthirnegii555", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/2Cc1YwU-uCrqW2z5qvi5AkqQE1B24SRxdmfPyDze9eyV1Sux1rRBrAOLxTFmE3GC3YMqYbZsL6k=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "what"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20937.75, "timestamp": "05:48:57", "text": "像我这样的傻瓜才会讲这样的故事"}]